/*!
\page page_strpsplane StRpsPlane

\brief A single silicon strip detector plane inside a Roman Pot station.

\section rpsplane_overview Overview

StRpsPlane represents one of four silicon strip detector planes housed inside a
single Roman Pot station of the **Roman Pot System (RPS)**.  It holds the reconstructed
cluster collection together with alignment geometry (z-position, offset, rotation angle,
strip orientation) and a hardware status flag.

**Detector**: Roman Pot System (RPS / pp2pp)  
**Stage**: Cluster container + geometry alignment

\section rpsplane_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StRpsPlane
\endcode

Position in the detector hierarchy:

\code
StRpsCollection → StRpsRomanPot[0..7] → StRpsPlane[0..3] → StRpsCluster
\endcode

\section rpsplane_orientation Strip Orientation

| \c mOrientation | Sensitive axis |
|----------------|----------------|
| 0 | x-measuring |
| 1 | y-measuring |

\section rpsplane_members Data Members

| Type | Member | Description |
|------|--------|-------------|
| \c UChar_t | \c mPlaneId | Plane index within the Roman Pot (0–3) |
| \c Double_t | \c mOffset | Alignment offset along the strip-sensitive axis (cm) |
| \c Double_t | \c mZ | z-position along the beam axis (cm) |
| \c Double_t | \c mAngle | Rotation angle about the beam axis (rad) |
| \c Short_t | \c mOrientation | Strip orientation code (0 = x, 1 = y) |
| \c UChar_t | \c mStatus | Plane status flag (0 = good) |
| \c UChar_t | \c mRomanPotId | Parent Roman Pot index (0–7) |
| \c StSPtrVecRpsCluster | \c mClusters | Reconstructed clusters in this plane |

\section rpsplane_methods Key Methods

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| \c planeId() | Plane index (0–3) |
| \c romanPotId() | Parent Roman Pot index (0–7) |
| \c offset() | Alignment offset (cm) |
| \c z() | z-position (cm) |
| \c angle() | Rotation angle (rad) |
| \c orientation() | Strip orientation (0 = x, 1 = y) |
| \c status() | Plane status flag |
| \c numberOfClusters() | Number of reconstructed clusters |
| \c cluster(i) | Cluster at index i |
| \c addCluster(StRpsCluster*) | Add cluster (also sets parent IDs on the cluster) |

\section rpsplane_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StRpsPlane* plane = rp->plane(ip);
if (plane->status() != 0) continue; // skip bad planes
for (unsigned int ic = 0; ic < plane->numberOfClusters(); ++ic) {
    const StRpsCluster* cl = plane->cluster(ic);
    double pos = cl->position() + plane->offset();
}
\endcode

\see StRpsCluster, StRpsRomanPot, StRpsCollection
*/
